{
  "atom": "cli/atoms/std-orb-lint-listen-wildcard-unkeyed.lolo",
  "trait": "OrbLintListenWildcardUnkeyed",
  "note": "Cases copy the six listen_unkeyed.rs unit tests (unguarded, guard not reading the key, keyed guard control, explicit-source control, non-CallKey control, echo-only service control) plus a nested-guard control. Expected findings are the code, path, message and suggestion the Rust validator reports; severity is warning.",
  "cases": [
    {
